          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='12'>Dry goods, breakfast, and other departments had lower profits. Sushi Nori, AFC Sushi Spicy Salmon Rolls, and other items consistently lost money.</run>
