          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#59a14f' fontsize='12'>Personal care, snack, and other departments performed well with volume and some total margins over 100%. Fresh ground beef and Almond cake products had excellent metrics.</run>
